! I.frr — Stub AS, customer of B
!
! I has a single upstream connection to provider B (10.1.4.2).
!
! As a stub, I:
!   - Announces only its own prefix (10.255.9.1/32) to B via the 'network' statement.
!   - Accepts all routes from B for global reachability.
!   - Provides no transit to any other AS.
!
! Money logic: I pays B for transit. No other commercial relationships exist.

route-map FROM-PROVIDER permit 10
 set local-preference 100
!
router bgp __ASN__
 address-family ipv4 unicast
  neighbor 10.1.4.2 route-map FROM-PROVIDER in
 exit-address-family
!
